# Terraform / OpenTofu
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Helm — exclude downloaded charts but keep dfe-common library chart
# (ArgoCD needs the packaged library chart since it can't resolve file:// deps)
**/charts/*.tgz
!helm/charts/*/charts/dfe-common-*.tgz

# Secrets / certs
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Scratch / temp
.tmp/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# AI agent working files (not committed)
docs/superpowers/
